  "rulings": [
    {
      "text": "No blood can be gained if a reaction card is played and canceled as it is played: it has still been played. [LSJ 20070330]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[LSJ 20070330]",
          "label": "LSJ 20070330",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/gsI3SYz2g3o/#m1"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cards and effects that can be played \"after resolution\" can be played after the gain blood effect. [ANK 20190113]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[ANK 20190113]",
          "label": "ANK 20190113",
          "url": "https://www.vekn.net/forum/rules-questions/77290-freak-drive-capitalist?start=12#92827"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The blood can be gained if the action is unblocked even if it has no effect (due to lack of a suitable target, for example). [LSJ 20070411]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[LSJ 20070411]",
          "label": "LSJ 20070411",
          "url": "https://usenet.krcg.org/t/umdINigMKqs/#m1"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Once each turn\" means once during each player's turn. [ANK 20180719-4]",
      "group": "Once each turn",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[ANK 20180719-4]",
          "label": "ANK 20180719-4",
          "url": "https://www.vekn.net/forum/rules-questions/76833-once-each-turn#89014"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The vampire's controller chooses to use the effect of the card or not. [ANK 20210309-3]",
      "group": "Master on vampire who can use it",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[ANK 20210309-3]",
          "label": "ANK 20210309-3",
          "url": "https://www.vekn.net/forum/rules-questions/79065-master-cards-attached-to-a-stolen-minion#101806"
        }
      ],
      "cards": [],
      "symbols": []
    }
  ],
  "cards": [],
  "text": "Archetype.\nPut this card on a vampire you control. Once each turn, this vampire can gain 1 blood after performing a successful action during which no reaction cards were played. A vampire can have only one archetype.",
